    "detailed_description": "<i>Bulbs 2.0</i> offers a unique twist on logic puzzles, combining the art of color mixing with strategic gameplay. Your board is filled with colored bulbs that affect their own light and its neighbors. Turn a red into a purple, a blue into a green, and much more\u2014all with a single move. But every action causes a reaction: swap a bulb's color, and neighboring bulbs will shift too.<br><br>Your goal is to turn the whole board white within a limited number of steps. With <strong>over 100 levels</strong>, <i>Bulbs 2.0</i> challenges you to think ahead and strategize each move carefully. From small grids to large, complex boards, every level offers a fresh puzzle that tests your logic and color-mixing skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>100+ levels of color-based logic puzzles<br></li><li>Challenging gameplay with a limited number of moves<br></li><li>Puzzles that vary in difficulty by board size<br></li><li>Simple, intuitive interface designed for maximum puzzle-solving satisfaction</li></ul><br>Dive into <i>Bulbs 2.0</i> and see if you can light up the entire board!",
